* bench_cap_esr: capacitor with its equivalent series resistance (ESR) and inductance (ESL), plus a parallel leak.
* Ports a b. C: capacitance (F). ESR: series resistance (ohm). ESL: series inductance (H).
* RLEAK: insulation or leakage resistance (ohm). It is also the DC path, so a capacitor-only node solves.
* Polarity and voltage rating are not modelled; the values are generic per technology.
.subckt bench_cap_esr a b params: C=1u ESR=10m ESL=1n RLEAK=1G
LESL a n1 {ESL}
RESR n1 n2 {ESR}
CCAP n2 b {C}
RLK a b {RLEAK}
.ends bench_cap_esr
